  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (But when would I find the time?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218407
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I think the only reason I still have the title of guard captain is because
      saving the world takes priority over petty thievery.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I still don't really know what exactly I'm supposed to do, ahaha...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218408
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I guess I'm lucky my fake-it-'til-you-make-it-strategy's been working
      out so far.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218409
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218410
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I don't even know where I'm supposed to be patrolling-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218411
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Around that cave that we raided, where we found Natsuki?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218412
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c3dd8de5b66462c489c46f09a84b83a5, type: 2}
    dialog: Monika?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218425
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Hmm?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, hi Natsuki.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218415
    - rid: 4927988405324218416
    - rid: 4927988405324218414
    - rid: 4927988405324218426
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc} and I went and got his sword earlier today-'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218417
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: And we were wondering what you were up to, since you weren't at the Skyforge.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218418
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Guh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218420
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Are... you alright?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218419
    - rid: 4927988405324218427
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: No!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218421
    - rid: 4927988405324218423
    - rid: 4927988405324218424
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm sorry?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218428
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Just come with me for a bit, I'm pissed and need to rant.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218429
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, uh, alright then...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218430
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So... what happened?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218433
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Huuhh... alright.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988405324218434
    - rid: 4927988405324218435
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: So we were going down to Falkreath-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988425389244416
    - rid: 4927988425389244417
    - rid: 4927988425389244420
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, we? Who did you go with? Also, Falkreath-?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988425389244418
    - rid: 4927988425389244421
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Falkreath's the hold southwest of here, you never been yet?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988425389244422
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: It's actually pretty nice down there; warmer than up here for sure.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988425389244423
    - rid: 4927988425389244424
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Anyway, I was going with Aela, Farkas, and Vilkas-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988425389244425
    - rid: 4927988425389244426
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't know who those people are.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988425389244479
    - rid: 4927988425389244480
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: They're my Shield-Siblings, fellow Companions-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988425389244481
    - rid: 4927988425389244483
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Are you gonna keep interrupting me, or are you gonna let me finish?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988425389244482
    - rid: 4927988425389244484
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Sorry.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988425389244485
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988425389244488
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: So we went down to Falkreath to go kill some witches-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988425389244486
    - rid: 4927988425389244487
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Witches-?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988425389244489
    - rid: 4927988425389244490
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, sorry. I interrupted again, didn't I?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988425389244491
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988425389244492
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: We got to the cave, and there were like five witches in there.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988425389244493
    - rid: 4927988425389244494
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Four of them go down easy enough-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, not easy, but we lived.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334272
    - rid: 4927988452881334273
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: But that last witch said some weird prayer and teleported us away, one
      by one!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334275
    - rid: 4927988452881334276
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I was warped way up north, to some fort with a bunch of Silverhand-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334277
    - rid: 4927988452881334278
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: And it was friggin' cold!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334279
    - rid: 4927988452881334280
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Haaahh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334281
    - rid: 4927988452881334282
    - rid: 4927988452881334283
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, I can take questions now.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334284
    - rid: 4927988452881334285
    - rid: 4927988452881334286
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Don't mind if I do!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334287
    - rid: 4927988452881334288
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Are you sure that witch teleported you?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334289
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Yep. She said something about the spirits taking us to our enemies-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334291
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Which is probably why the fort I ended up at was filled with Silver Hand.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334292
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Hmm... So teleportation is possible through some sort of witchcraft or
      druidry...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334293
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Do we need to teleport somewhere?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334294
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, I guess we don't <i>need</i> to...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334295
    - rid: 4927988452881334297
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: But this place doesn't have convenient walking distances or public transit.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334298
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I guess you're right; my legs <i>have</i> been pretty sore from all the
      walking.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334299
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: When {mc} gets back from whatever he's up to, we should let him know
      about it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Where is {mc}, anyway?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334300
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Skuldafn, apparently you can't get there on foot.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334301
    - rid: 4927988452881334302
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh... so what are you up to, then?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334303
    - rid: 4927988452881334304
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Officially, I'm on patrol!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334305
    - rid: 4927988452881334306
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: You're the only thing of note I've found.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334307
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Neat.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334308
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Have you seen Aela, Farkas, or Vilkas?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334309
    - rid: 4927988452881334310
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: One's a meathead with long black hair, a scraggly beard, and heavy eye-shadow...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: One's that guy's brother, pretty similar but he's got short hair and
      different armor...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: And the other's an... aggressive lady with long brown hair, dark warpaint,
      and... old-looking armor.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Nope. Haven't seen anyone like that-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334311
    - rid: 4927988452881334312
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, actually, I might've seen that long-haired guy back in Whiterun when
      I was leaving.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334313
    - rid: 4927988452881334314
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Might've? Farkas is pretty distinctive...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334316
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, well, on my way out of town I was lost in thought.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334317
    - rid: 4927988452881334318
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: <i>Right</i>...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, I'm heading up to Jorrvaskr then.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334319
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: See you around, Monika.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334320
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: See you later, Natsuki.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334321
    - rid: 4927988452881334322
    - rid: 4927988452881334323
    - rid: 4927988452881334324
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Alright, if Monika's memory is correct, Farkas should probably be back
      at Jorrvaskr by now.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Hopefully the other two are alright too...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334325
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334326
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334327
    - rid: 4927988452881334328
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Shield-Sister, you're safe!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334330
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Yep! I'm glad you guys are alright too.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334332
    - rid: 4927988452881334333
    - rid: 4927988452881334334
    - rid: 4927988452881334335
    - rid: 4927988452881334336
    - rid: 4927988452881334337
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Did you guys get warped to Silver Hand holdouts too?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334338
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: That's right.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334339
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: I was sent to the Reach, Aela was in Riften, and Farkas was in Morthal.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: It was snowy and mountainous where I ended up, so I was either around
      Winterhold or the Pale.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334340
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: I see...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334341
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Oh- and I also found these:'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334342
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki gets out the fragments of Wuuthrad she picked up.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334344
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Vilkas, do you think we have all of them now?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: All of them? All of the fragments?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334345
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Only one way to find out, come over here.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334346
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The four of them make their way toward the fragment display on the wall.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Oh wow, we <i>do</i> have most of them.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Go ahead and put all of your pieces up there, so we can see if there's
      any more we need to find.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki arranges her pieces into the axe jigsaw-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: ... with some difficulty...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334347
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: And only a single piece was missing!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334348
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: By Ysmir-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334350
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: After all these years... the only piece not displayed should be the one
      in Kodlak's room.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: I suppose we have that witch to thank- and the Silver Hand for gathering
      them together for us.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: I'll go get Eorlund.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: With these, we'll be able to enter Ysgramor's tomb to free Kodlak's soul-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334349
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, but we need a witch's head to do that, did we remember to get one?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334351
    - rid: 4927988452881334352
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334353
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: (... Damnit-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334354
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: I've got two.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334355
    - rid: 4927988452881334356
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Seriously?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, yeah, those heads were the whole reason we went.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334357
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: It'd be really stupid to forget.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334358
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: R-right...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: By the Nine...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334359
    - rid: 4927988452881334360
    - rid: 4927988452881334361
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, Eorlund. Want to reforge one of the mightiest axes in history?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: What sort of pathetic smith would deny this opportunity?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Of course I do; we could use the morale boost after Kodlak's death.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: The last piece is still in Kodlak's room.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, thank you. I'll get started right away!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Eorlund makes his way downstairs to collect the final piece.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334362
    - rid: 4927988452881334364
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: It's just a matter of time now until we can grant Kodlak his just rest.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334363
    - rid: 4927988452881334365
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Indeed, and the Silver Hand should be reeling from the damage we managed
      to do while split up.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: I could use a drink, been standin' around for too long.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Farkas makes his way to his seat at the dining tables, ready to drink
      his weariness away.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334366
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Can't argue with that.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Shield-Sister, I'd like a word with you before we get lunch too.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334367
    - rid: 4927988452881334369
    - rid: 4927988452881334370
    - rid: 4927988452881334371
    - rid: 4927988452881334373
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah? What's up, Vilkas?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334372
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Have you been able to keep your beast blood in check?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334374
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334376
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I mean, mostly?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334375
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Whenever I see a fresh corpse I feel the urge to... give in.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: But I haven't given into that yet.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334377
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I did rely on my werewolf form to make it out of the Silver Hand stronghold
      the witch warped me to-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334381
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: But I was surrounded; I couldn't find a better way out of that situation.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334382
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Did you manage to maintain control over yourself during that, which was
      your second transformation, right?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334383
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I didn't take a bite out of a single one of them-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334384
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: And I was able to consciously revert from the form when I was out of
      immediate danger.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334385
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Although, I might've jumped the gun on it, the fur helped with the cold.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334386
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Good, good.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334387
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Since Farkas has a second head, I was thinking of cleansing your soul
      while we're there-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Since you might be more of an immediate threat, because you're less experienced.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: But, it seems it might not be that pressing of a concern after all.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I'd still prefer to get cured first, if that's alright.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334388
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Sure.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334389
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Farkas and I have gotten pretty good at suppressing the transformation,
      and I doubt Aela would do it even if we had enough heads for her-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: So I don't see a reason why we shouldn't cure you first.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, that's all I had for now, let's join the others.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Vilkas and Natsuki join their Shield-Siblings at the dining tables, ready
      to grab some grub.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988452881334390
    - rid: 4927988452881334391
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: (So when will be paying our respects to Kodlak?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: (Ah. We should be able to make our preparations for that today...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
